title: "tidydiversity: Taxonomic, Phylogenetic and Functional Diversity with Tidy Hill Numbers"
abstract: "Tidy, pipe-friendly estimation of taxonomic, phylogenetic and functional diversity as Hill numbers, with coverage-based rarefaction and extrapolation, beta-diversity partitioning and publication-ready plots."
